# Lab 3 – Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)

## Dataset
Ecommerce Sales Data (2024–2025)  
Source: Kaggle

This dataset contains e-commerce sales records, including order details, customer information, product categories, sales, profit, and payment modes.

## Objective
The goal of this lab is to perform Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) to understand the dataset structure and extract basic insights.

## Tasks
- Load the dataset
- Explore the data (shape, columns, info)
- Check missing values
- Compute basic statistics
- Analyze sales and profit by category and region
- Visualize simple distributions
